{"website":{"seo":{"siteTitle":"","metaDescription":"","defaultKeywords":[],"canonicalBase":"","ogImage":"","twitterHandle":"","googleSiteVerification":"","bingSiteVerification":"","googleAnalyticsId":"","googleTagManagerId":""},"technical":{"robotsTxt":"User-agent: *\nAllow: \/","htaccess":"","blogPath":"\/blog","includeBlogsInSitemap":true},"_id":"6abd61264798ced72885fea2","name":"besttraveladvisory","domain":"besttraveladvisory.com","description":"","platform":"coded","active":true,"faviconUrl":"","createdAt":"2026-09-30T19:21:10.642Z","__v":0},"blog":{"cta":{"label":"Get Quote","url":"\/contact"},"_id":"6ac1f6ad01767108a445e421","websiteId":"6abd61264798ced72885fea2","title":"How to Find Cheap Flights Every Time You Travel","slug":"how-to-find-cheap-flights","content":"<p>Everyone&nbsp;wants&nbsp;to&nbsp;save&nbsp;money&nbsp;on&nbsp;flights.&nbsp;But&nbsp;with&nbsp;prices&nbsp;changing&nbsp;every&nbsp;few&nbsp;hours,&nbsp;it&nbsp;can&nbsp;feel&nbsp;impossible.&nbsp;The&nbsp;truth&nbsp;is,&nbsp;<strong>how&nbsp;to&nbsp;find&nbsp;cheap&nbsp;flights<\/strong>&nbsp;is&nbsp;not&nbsp;about&nbsp;luck&nbsp;\u2014&nbsp;it&#39;s&nbsp;about&nbsp;knowing&nbsp;a&nbsp;few&nbsp;simple&nbsp;tricks.<\/p><p>In&nbsp;this&nbsp;guide,&nbsp;we&#39;ll&nbsp;walk&nbsp;you&nbsp;through&nbsp;exactly&nbsp;what&nbsp;to&nbsp;do,&nbsp;step&nbsp;by&nbsp;step.&nbsp;From&nbsp;when&nbsp;to&nbsp;book,&nbsp;to&nbsp;which&nbsp;apps&nbsp;to&nbsp;use,&nbsp;to&nbsp;which&nbsp;airlines&nbsp;save&nbsp;you&nbsp;the&nbsp;most&nbsp;money.<\/p><p><\/p><h2><strong>When&nbsp;Is&nbsp;the&nbsp;Best&nbsp;Time&nbsp;to&nbsp;Book&nbsp;a&nbsp;Flight?&nbsp;<\/strong><\/h2><p><\/p><p>Timing&nbsp;is&nbsp;everything.&nbsp;Book&nbsp;too&nbsp;early&nbsp;or&nbsp;too&nbsp;late,&nbsp;and&nbsp;you&#39;ll&nbsp;pay&nbsp;more&nbsp;than&nbsp;you&nbsp;need&nbsp;to.<\/p><p>Here&#39;s&nbsp;a&nbsp;simple&nbsp;breakdown:<\/p><p><\/p><ul><li><strong>Domestic&nbsp;flights:<\/strong>&nbsp;Book&nbsp;about&nbsp;<strong>30&nbsp;days&nbsp;before<\/strong>&nbsp;your&nbsp;trip.&nbsp;Average&nbsp;fares&nbsp;are&nbsp;around&nbsp;$228.<\/li><li><strong>International&nbsp;flights:<\/strong>&nbsp;Book&nbsp;<strong>2&nbsp;to&nbsp;6&nbsp;months&nbsp;ahead<\/strong>&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;best&nbsp;prices.&nbsp;Last-minute&nbsp;international&nbsp;deals&nbsp;exist,&nbsp;but&nbsp;they&#39;re&nbsp;risky.<\/li><li><strong>Peak&nbsp;seasons&nbsp;(summer,&nbsp;holidays):<\/strong>&nbsp;Always&nbsp;book&nbsp;early&nbsp;\u2014&nbsp;at&nbsp;least&nbsp;3&nbsp;to&nbsp;4&nbsp;months&nbsp;ahead.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><p><strong>Cheapest&nbsp;days&nbsp;to&nbsp;fly:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>Domestic:<\/strong>&nbsp;Depart&nbsp;on&nbsp;Monday,&nbsp;return&nbsp;on&nbsp;Wednesday<\/li><li><strong>International:<\/strong>&nbsp;Wednesday&nbsp;is&nbsp;cheapest&nbsp;for&nbsp;both&nbsp;departure&nbsp;and&nbsp;return<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><p>And&nbsp;no&nbsp;\u2014&nbsp;booking&nbsp;on&nbsp;a&nbsp;Tuesday&nbsp;does&nbsp;NOT&nbsp;automatically&nbsp;save&nbsp;you&nbsp;money.&nbsp;That&#39;s&nbsp;a&nbsp;myth.&nbsp;What&nbsp;really&nbsp;matters&nbsp;is&nbsp;how&nbsp;far&nbsp;ahead&nbsp;you&nbsp;book.<\/p><p><\/p><h2><strong>Best&nbsp;Apps&nbsp;and&nbsp;Websites&nbsp;to&nbsp;Find&nbsp;Cheap&nbsp;Flights<\/strong><\/h2><p><\/p><p>Using&nbsp;the&nbsp;right&nbsp;tool&nbsp;makes&nbsp;a&nbsp;big&nbsp;difference.&nbsp;Here&nbsp;are&nbsp;the&nbsp;best&nbsp;ones:<\/p><p><\/p><ul><li><strong>Momondo<\/strong>&nbsp;\u2014&nbsp;Best&nbsp;overall.&nbsp;Shows&nbsp;baggage&nbsp;fees&nbsp;in&nbsp;results&nbsp;so&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;compare&nbsp;true&nbsp;costs.<\/li><li><strong>Google&nbsp;Flights<\/strong>&nbsp;\u2014&nbsp;Fast,&nbsp;clean,&nbsp;and&nbsp;has&nbsp;a&nbsp;great&nbsp;price&nbsp;calendar.&nbsp;Perfect&nbsp;for&nbsp;checking&nbsp;flexible&nbsp;dates.<\/li><li><strong>Skyscanner<\/strong>&nbsp;\u2014&nbsp;Great&nbsp;for&nbsp;advance&nbsp;bookings.&nbsp;Has&nbsp;an&nbsp;&quot;Everywhere&quot;&nbsp;search&nbsp;feature&nbsp;to&nbsp;find&nbsp;the&nbsp;cheapest&nbsp;destination.<\/li><li><strong>KAYAK<\/strong>&nbsp;\u2014&nbsp;Has&nbsp;a&nbsp;&quot;Price&nbsp;Forecast&quot;&nbsp;tool&nbsp;that&nbsp;tells&nbsp;you&nbsp;whether&nbsp;to&nbsp;book&nbsp;now&nbsp;or&nbsp;wait.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><p><strong>Pro&nbsp;tip:<\/strong>&nbsp;Set&nbsp;up&nbsp;fare&nbsp;alerts&nbsp;on&nbsp;any&nbsp;of&nbsp;these&nbsp;platforms.&nbsp;Enter&nbsp;your&nbsp;route,&nbsp;pick&nbsp;a&nbsp;price&nbsp;target,&nbsp;and&nbsp;you&#39;ll&nbsp;get&nbsp;notified&nbsp;when&nbsp;fares&nbsp;drop.&nbsp;This&nbsp;is&nbsp;one&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;easiest&nbsp;ways&nbsp;to&nbsp;save&nbsp;without&nbsp;doing&nbsp;constant&nbsp;research.<\/p><p><\/p><h2><strong>Why&nbsp;Flexibility&nbsp;Is&nbsp;Your&nbsp;Best&nbsp;Friend<\/strong><\/h2><p><\/p><p>If&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;flexible&nbsp;with&nbsp;your&nbsp;dates&nbsp;or&nbsp;destination,&nbsp;you&#39;ll&nbsp;almost&nbsp;always&nbsp;find&nbsp;a&nbsp;cheaper&nbsp;flight.<\/p><p>Here&#39;s&nbsp;how:<\/p><p><\/p><ul><li>Flying&nbsp;<strong>Tuesday&nbsp;or&nbsp;Wednesday<\/strong>&nbsp;instead&nbsp;of&nbsp;Friday&nbsp;can&nbsp;save&nbsp;you&nbsp;30\u201340%&nbsp;on&nbsp;domestic&nbsp;routes.<\/li><li>Use&nbsp;<strong>Google&nbsp;Flights&#39;&nbsp;Explore&nbsp;map<\/strong>&nbsp;\u2014&nbsp;enter&nbsp;your&nbsp;city&nbsp;and&nbsp;it&nbsp;shows&nbsp;you&nbsp;the&nbsp;cheapest&nbsp;places&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;fly&nbsp;to.<\/li><li>Use&nbsp;<strong>Skyscanner&#39;s&nbsp;&quot;Everywhere&quot;&nbsp;search<\/strong>&nbsp;to&nbsp;discover&nbsp;surprise&nbsp;deals.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><p>Looking&nbsp;for&nbsp;destination&nbsp;ideas?&nbsp;Check&nbsp;out&nbsp;our&nbsp;<strong>Visa&nbsp;Free&nbsp;Countries&nbsp;For&nbsp;Indian&nbsp;Travelers&nbsp;guide<\/strong>,&nbsp;or&nbsp;browse&nbsp;our&nbsp;How&nbsp;to&nbsp;Visit&nbsp;Khao&nbsp;Sok&nbsp;National&nbsp;Park&nbsp;in&nbsp;Thailand&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Muna&nbsp;Island&nbsp;Travel&nbsp;Guide<\/strong>&nbsp;posts&nbsp;for&nbsp;inspiration.<\/p><p><\/p><h2><strong>Simple&nbsp;Flight&nbsp;Booking&nbsp;Hacks&nbsp;That&nbsp;Actually&nbsp;Work<\/strong><\/h2><p><\/p><p>These&nbsp;small&nbsp;habits&nbsp;can&nbsp;save&nbsp;you&nbsp;real&nbsp;money:<\/p><p><\/p><ul><li><strong>Use&nbsp;incognito&nbsp;mode&nbsp;when&nbsp;searching.<\/strong>&nbsp;Booking&nbsp;sites&nbsp;track&nbsp;your&nbsp;searches&nbsp;and&nbsp;may&nbsp;raise&nbsp;prices&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;look&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;same&nbsp;flight&nbsp;more&nbsp;than&nbsp;once.&nbsp;Private&nbsp;browsing&nbsp;stops&nbsp;that.<\/li><li><strong>Book&nbsp;directly&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;airline.<\/strong>&nbsp;Third-party&nbsp;sites&nbsp;often&nbsp;add&nbsp;$10\u201330&nbsp;in&nbsp;extra&nbsp;fees.&nbsp;Booking&nbsp;direct&nbsp;is&nbsp;also&nbsp;easier&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;need&nbsp;to&nbsp;make&nbsp;changes.<\/li><li><strong>Mix&nbsp;one-way&nbsp;tickets&nbsp;from&nbsp;different&nbsp;airlines.<\/strong>&nbsp;Sometimes&nbsp;buying&nbsp;two&nbsp;separate&nbsp;one-way&nbsp;tickets&nbsp;is&nbsp;cheaper&nbsp;than&nbsp;a&nbsp;round&nbsp;trip&nbsp;on&nbsp;one&nbsp;airline.&nbsp;You&nbsp;can&nbsp;save&nbsp;$40\u201380&nbsp;this&nbsp;way.<\/li><li><strong>Follow&nbsp;airlines&nbsp;on&nbsp;social&nbsp;media.<\/strong>&nbsp;Budget&nbsp;carriers&nbsp;like&nbsp;Spirit&nbsp;and&nbsp;Ryanair&nbsp;post&nbsp;flash&nbsp;sales&nbsp;that&nbsp;last&nbsp;only&nbsp;24\u201348&nbsp;hours.&nbsp;These&nbsp;deals&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;50\u201380%&nbsp;off&nbsp;normal&nbsp;prices.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h2><strong>Budget&nbsp;Airlines:&nbsp;Are&nbsp;They&nbsp;Worth&nbsp;It?<\/strong><\/h2><p><\/p><p>Yes&nbsp;\u2014&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;know&nbsp;what&nbsp;you&#39;re&nbsp;getting&nbsp;into.<\/p><p><\/p><p>Budget&nbsp;airlines&nbsp;are&nbsp;now&nbsp;a&nbsp;huge&nbsp;part&nbsp;of&nbsp;air&nbsp;travel.&nbsp;They&nbsp;operate&nbsp;over&nbsp;35%&nbsp;of&nbsp;all&nbsp;scheduled&nbsp;flights&nbsp;worldwide,&nbsp;and&nbsp;their&nbsp;base&nbsp;fares&nbsp;are&nbsp;typically&nbsp;40\u201365%&nbsp;cheaper&nbsp;than&nbsp;big&nbsp;carriers.<\/p><p><\/p><p>Just&nbsp;remember:&nbsp;budget&nbsp;airlines&nbsp;often&nbsp;charge&nbsp;extra&nbsp;for&nbsp;bags&nbsp;and&nbsp;seat&nbsp;selection.&nbsp;Even&nbsp;with&nbsp;those&nbsp;fees,&nbsp;you&#39;re&nbsp;usually&nbsp;saving&nbsp;25\u201340%&nbsp;compared&nbsp;to&nbsp;full-service&nbsp;airlines.<\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>Top&nbsp;budget&nbsp;airlines&nbsp;by&nbsp;region:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>North&nbsp;America:<\/strong>&nbsp;Southwest&nbsp;(2&nbsp;free&nbsp;checked&nbsp;bags!),&nbsp;Frontier,&nbsp;Allegiant&nbsp;Air,&nbsp;JetBlue<\/li><li><strong>Europe:<\/strong>&nbsp;Ryanair&nbsp;(~\u20ac40&nbsp;average&nbsp;one-way),&nbsp;easyJet,&nbsp;Wizz&nbsp;Air,&nbsp;Norwegian<\/li><li><strong>Asia-Pacific:<\/strong>&nbsp;AirAsia,&nbsp;IndiGo,&nbsp;Scoot,&nbsp;Jetstar<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><p><strong>Long-haul&nbsp;budget&nbsp;options:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>Norse&nbsp;Atlantic&nbsp;Airways<\/strong>&nbsp;\u2014&nbsp;Europe&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;U.S.&nbsp;from&nbsp;just&nbsp;$99\u2013199&nbsp;one-way<\/li><li><strong>French&nbsp;Bee<\/strong>&nbsp;\u2014&nbsp;Paris&nbsp;to&nbsp;New&nbsp;York&nbsp;or&nbsp;San&nbsp;Francisco,&nbsp;roughly&nbsp;50%&nbsp;cheaper&nbsp;than&nbsp;Air&nbsp;France<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><p><strong>Also&nbsp;consider&nbsp;alternate&nbsp;airports.<\/strong>&nbsp;Flying&nbsp;into&nbsp;a&nbsp;secondary&nbsp;airport&nbsp;(like&nbsp;London&nbsp;Stansted&nbsp;instead&nbsp;of&nbsp;Heathrow)&nbsp;can&nbsp;cut&nbsp;fares&nbsp;by&nbsp;30\u201350%.&nbsp;Just&nbsp;check&nbsp;how&nbsp;far&nbsp;the&nbsp;airport&nbsp;is&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;city&nbsp;first.<\/p><p><\/p><p>Planning&nbsp;your&nbsp;trip?&nbsp;See&nbsp;our&nbsp;[Planning&nbsp;a&nbsp;Kauai&nbsp;trip]&nbsp;guide,&nbsp;our&nbsp;How&nbsp;to&nbsp;Explore&nbsp;the&nbsp;Famous&nbsp;Batu&nbsp;Caves&nbsp;in&nbsp;Kuala&nbsp;Lumpur&nbsp;post,&nbsp;or&nbsp;our&nbsp;<strong><u><a href=\"https:\/\/besttraveladvisory.com\/worlds-most-expensive-hotels-luxury-stays\/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">World&#39;s&nbsp;Most&nbsp;Expensive&nbsp;Hotels<\/a><\/u><\/strong>&nbsp;article&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;treat&nbsp;yourself&nbsp;once&nbsp;you&#39;ve&nbsp;saved&nbsp;on&nbsp;flights.<\/p><p><\/p><h2><strong>Use&nbsp;Points&nbsp;and&nbsp;Miles&nbsp;to&nbsp;Fly&nbsp;for&nbsp;Less<\/strong><\/h2><p><\/p><p>This&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;part&nbsp;most&nbsp;travelers&nbsp;skip&nbsp;\u2014&nbsp;and&nbsp;it&#39;s&nbsp;a&nbsp;big&nbsp;mistake.<\/p><p><\/p><p>Almost&nbsp;every&nbsp;airline&nbsp;has&nbsp;a&nbsp;<strong>free&nbsp;loyalty&nbsp;program<\/strong>.&nbsp;Sign&nbsp;up&nbsp;even&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;only&nbsp;fly&nbsp;occasionally.&nbsp;Benefits&nbsp;often&nbsp;include:<\/p><p><\/p><ul><li>Early&nbsp;access&nbsp;to&nbsp;flash&nbsp;sales&nbsp;(sometimes&nbsp;24&nbsp;hours&nbsp;before&nbsp;the&nbsp;public)<\/li><li>Free&nbsp;seat&nbsp;selection&nbsp;at&nbsp;check-in<\/li><li>Faster&nbsp;customer&nbsp;service<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><p>If&nbsp;you&nbsp;use&nbsp;a&nbsp;<strong>travel&nbsp;credit&nbsp;card<\/strong>,&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;earn&nbsp;points&nbsp;on&nbsp;everyday&nbsp;purchases&nbsp;like&nbsp;groceries&nbsp;and&nbsp;gas&nbsp;\u2014&nbsp;then&nbsp;use&nbsp;those&nbsp;points&nbsp;toward&nbsp;flights.&nbsp;Cards&nbsp;like&nbsp;Chase&nbsp;Sapphire,&nbsp;Amex&nbsp;Gold,&nbsp;or&nbsp;Capital&nbsp;One&nbsp;Venture&nbsp;let&nbsp;you&nbsp;transfer&nbsp;points&nbsp;to&nbsp;multiple&nbsp;airlines,&nbsp;giving&nbsp;you&nbsp;more&nbsp;flexibility.<\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>Smart&nbsp;tips&nbsp;for&nbsp;using&nbsp;points:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Use&nbsp;miles&nbsp;for&nbsp;peak&nbsp;travel&nbsp;dates&nbsp;when&nbsp;cash&nbsp;prices&nbsp;are&nbsp;highest<\/li><li>Watch&nbsp;for&nbsp;transfer&nbsp;bonuses&nbsp;when&nbsp;moving&nbsp;points&nbsp;to&nbsp;airline&nbsp;partners<\/li><li>Time&nbsp;big&nbsp;purchases&nbsp;with&nbsp;credit&nbsp;card&nbsp;sign-up&nbsp;bonuses&nbsp;before&nbsp;a&nbsp;planned&nbsp;trip<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><p>Knowing&nbsp;<strong>how&nbsp;to&nbsp;find&nbsp;cheap&nbsp;flights<\/strong>&nbsp;isn&#39;t&nbsp;just&nbsp;about&nbsp;searching&nbsp;smarter&nbsp;\u2014&nbsp;it&#39;s&nbsp;about&nbsp;building&nbsp;habits&nbsp;that&nbsp;keep&nbsp;saving&nbsp;you&nbsp;money&nbsp;trip&nbsp;after&nbsp;trip.<\/p><p><\/p><h2><strong>Quick&nbsp;Summary:&nbsp;How&nbsp;to&nbsp;Find&nbsp;Cheap&nbsp;Flights<\/strong><\/h2><p><\/p><p>Here&#39;s&nbsp;everything&nbsp;in&nbsp;one&nbsp;place:<\/p><p><\/p><ol><li><strong>Book&nbsp;domestic&nbsp;flights&nbsp;30&nbsp;days&nbsp;out<\/strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;international&nbsp;flights&nbsp;2\u20136&nbsp;months&nbsp;ahead<\/li><li><strong>Fly&nbsp;on&nbsp;Tuesday,&nbsp;Wednesday,&nbsp;or&nbsp;Monday<\/strong>&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;lowest&nbsp;fares<\/li><li><strong>Use&nbsp;Momondo,&nbsp;Google&nbsp;Flights,&nbsp;or&nbsp;Skyscanner<\/strong>&nbsp;to&nbsp;compare&nbsp;prices<\/li><li><strong>Set&nbsp;fare&nbsp;alerts<\/strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;book&nbsp;when&nbsp;the&nbsp;price&nbsp;hits&nbsp;your&nbsp;target<\/li><li><strong>Search&nbsp;in&nbsp;incognito&nbsp;mode<\/strong>&nbsp;to&nbsp;avoid&nbsp;price&nbsp;tracking<\/li><li><strong>Consider&nbsp;budget&nbsp;airlines<\/strong>&nbsp;\u2014&nbsp;they&#39;re&nbsp;safe&nbsp;and&nbsp;can&nbsp;save&nbsp;you&nbsp;a&nbsp;lot<\/li><li><strong>Join&nbsp;airline&nbsp;loyalty&nbsp;programs<\/strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;use&nbsp;a&nbsp;travel&nbsp;credit&nbsp;card<\/li><\/ol><p><\/p><p>The&nbsp;more&nbsp;flexible&nbsp;you&nbsp;are,&nbsp;the&nbsp;more&nbsp;you&nbsp;save.&nbsp;Start&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;strategy,&nbsp;not&nbsp;just&nbsp;a&nbsp;destination.<\/p>","excerpt":"","featuredImage":"https:\/\/api.blog-panel.clickstar.pl\/uploads\/blogs\/1791096414786-5ed9f409-abd5-43f9-9f14-ad0f7f51758d.png","featuredImageAlt":"","images":[],"tags":[],"categoryId":{"_id":"6abd65774798ced72885ffa9","name":"Travel Guides","slug":"travel-guides","status":"active"},"authorName":"Admin","publishDate":"2026-10-04T00:00:00.000Z","focusKeyword":"How to Find Cheap Flights","secondaryKeywords":[],"metaTitle":"How to Find Cheap Flights Every Time You Travel","metaDescription":"Learn how to find cheap flights with proven booking tips, fare alerts, flexible dates, and money-saving strategies for your next trip.\n","metaKeyword":"","canonicalUrl":"","ogTitle":"How to Find Cheap Flights Every Time You Travel","ogDescription":"","ogImage":"","schemaType":"BlogPosting","robotsIndex":"index","robotsFollow":"follow","faqs":[{"question":"When should I book a domestic flight to get the cheapest price?","answer":"Book around 30 days before your trip. That's when average economy fares are lowest, sitting around $228. Booking too early or too close to the date usually costs more.","_id":"6ac1f6ad01767108a445e422"},{"question":"What are the cheapest days to fly?","answer":"For domestic travel, Monday is cheapest to depart and Wednesday cheapest to return. For international flights, Wednesday is the best day in both directions.","_id":"6ac1f6ad01767108a445e423"},{"question":"Which website finds the cheapest flights?","answer":"Momondo is rated the top overall tool \u2014 it's one of the few that shows baggage fees in search results. Skyscanner and Google Flights are also excellent choices.","_id":"6ac1f6ad01767108a445e424"},{"question":"Are budget airlines safe?","answer":"Yes. All airlines must follow the same safety regulations. In fact, low-cost carriers had an accident rate of 0.17 per million flights in 2025 \u2014 slightly lower than the global average of 0.20.","_id":"6ac1f6ad01767108a445e425"},{"question":"Does incognito mode help find cheaper flights?","answer":"It doesn't lower prices, but it prevents them from going up. Booking sites track your searches and may raise fares when they see repeat interest. Incognito mode stops that from happening.","_id":"6ac1f6ad01767108a445e426"},{"question":"Is it cheaper to book two one-way tickets instead of a round trip?","answer":"Often, yes. Budget airlines price each direction separately. Mixing two different carriers can save you $40\u201380 compared to booking a round trip on one airline.","_id":"6ac1f6ad01767108a445e427"}],"relatedProducts":[],"relatedBlogs":[],"youtubeUrl":"","internalLinks":[],"externalLinks":[],"status":"published","publishedAt":"2026-10-04T06:48:13.303Z","createdAt":"2026-10-04T06:48:13.305Z","__v":0,"category":{"id":"6abd65774798ced72885ffa9","name":"Travel Guides","slug":"travel-guides"}}}